 "description": "A band's concert history, newest first \u2014 use this for \"what did Radiohead play at their most recent show\". Pass `artist_name` and the band is resolved to its MusicBrainz ID for you, preferring an exact name match so a tribute act does not answer for the band; pass `mbid` directly when you have one. Returns setlists with date, venue, city, and full track lists.",
 "inputSchema": {
